<title>USA: Pasadena, Texas, schools repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Pasadena, Texas, schools repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said Tuesday it again repriced and restructured Pasadena Independent School District, Texas's $10.4 million bond deal, raising yields in several maturities and lifting the top yield in 2011 to 5.65 percent from 5.60 percent.</p>
<p>The new repricing follows:  </p>
